$$\frac{4}{2} = 2$$

Now that we have the result of the division, we can subtract 10 minus that result: $10 - 2$.

$$10 - 2 = 8$$

Finally, we must divide the two results obtained previously. This gives us:

$$8 \div 4 = 2$$

